      "name": "What is the difference between IEPL and IPLC?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Both are dedicated point-to-point circuits with the same privacy. IPLC runs on TDM over SDH or SONET, with a native TDM handoff and protection switching in under 50 milliseconds. IEPL presents an Ethernet interface, scales in Ethernet increments and suits traffic that is already IP-native. Our IPLC vs IEPL guide covers the choice in depth."
      }
    },
