      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is an Ethernet Private Line the same as an Ethernet Virtual Private Line?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. An Ethernet Private Line is dedicated and port-based. An Ethernet Virtual Private Line shares a physical port across several logical connections. The names are close and the products are not, so confirm in writing which one a quotation covers."
      }
